<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">西安电子科技大学本科生国家励志奖学金评审办法</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2025-10-30&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 10740)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_2 {  margin-top: 13.00pt;  margin-bottom: 13.00pt;  line-height: 1.73;  text-indent: 21.00pt;  text-align: center;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 方正小标宋简体;  min-height: 22.00pt;  font-size: 22.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_6 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_3 {  text-align: left;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_4 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_5 {  background-color: #FFFFFF;  min-height: 28pt;  line-height: 28pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_5 span {  font-family: 黑体;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;  background-color: #FFFFFF;}span.docx_8 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-weight: bold;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">西电学〔202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">〕</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">12</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">号</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第一章 &nbsp;总 &nbsp;则</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 23.7pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第一条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">为激励我校家庭经济困难学生勤奋学习、努力进取、德智体美劳全面发展，根据《财政部 教育部 人力资源社会保障部 退役军人部 中央军委国防动员部关于印发&lt;学生资助资金管理办法&gt;的通知》（财教〔2021〕310号）《关于调整高等教育阶段和高中阶段国家奖助学金政策的通知》（财教〔2024〕181号）有关精神，结合我校实际，特制定本办法。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第二条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家励志奖学金由中央政府出资设立，用于奖励资助我校全日制本科（含第二学士学位）学生中品学兼优的家庭经济困难学生。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第二章 &nbsp;奖励标准和申请条件</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 23.7pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第三条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家励志奖学金现行的奖励标准为每人每年6000元，一次性发放，如遇国家政策调整，以当年最新政策规定为准。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第四条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家励志奖学金的基本申请条件：</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.全日制计划内本科二年级以上（包括二年级）学生；</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;">2.具有中华人民共和国国籍；</p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3.热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导；</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">4.遵守宪法和法律，遵守学校规章制度；</span></p><p class="docx-num-0-0" style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">5.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">诚实守信，道德品质优良；</span></p><p class="docx-num-0-0" style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">.上一学年度学习成绩优秀，在本专业排名前30%；</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">.德智体美劳全面发展，综合测评成绩在本专业排名前30%；</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">8</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">.在评审学年是学校认定的家庭经济困难学生，生活简朴。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第三章 &nbsp;组织机构</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 23.7pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">五条</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家励志奖学金的评定工作在学校本科生资助工作领导小组的领导下，由学生资助管理中心具体负责组织评审工作。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第六条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">各单位成立由学院/学生社区党委副书记、辅导员组成的评审工作组，全面负责本单位国家励志奖学金的评审工作，党委副书记任组长。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第七条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">各辅导员具体负责其所带学生的国家励志奖学金申请和初评，成立由20%以上学生组成的民主评议小组，辅导员任组长。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第四章 &nbsp;申请和评审</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第八条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> 国家励志奖学金于每学年秋季学期开学初启动申请和评审。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第九条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家励志奖学金的申请：学生本人填写《西安电子科技大学国家励志奖学金申请表》（见附件），向民主评议小组提交申请。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> 国家励志奖学金的评审：实行等额评审，坚持公开、公平、公正、择优的原则，按照以下步骤组织评审。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;">1.民主评议小组评议评议小组应以对全体学生高度负责的态度，依据有关文件的要求对每个申请国家励志奖学金者认真评议。</p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.学院/学生社区评选各学院/学生社区评审工作组对民主评议小组的评议结果认真审核，严格把关，等额评选出本单位的国家励志奖学金推荐名单，在本单位范围内公示</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">个工作日，无异议后提交学校学生资助管理中心。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3.学校学生资助管理中心审核各单位将国家励志奖学金评选结果报送学校学生资助管理中心，学生资助管理中心复核后提出学校当年国家励志奖学金获奖学生建议名单，报学校本科生资助工作领导小组。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">4.学校审定推选学校本科生资助工作领导小组对国家励志奖学金获奖学生建议名单进行研究审定，由学生资助管理中心组织在全校公示5个工作日，无异议后报送全国学生资助管理中心。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第五章 &nbsp;国家励志奖学金的发放</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十一条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校接到教育部的批复名单后，计划财务处将国家励志奖学金一次性拨付至学生本人银行卡，本科生院将获奖记录记入学生档案。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十二条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">同一学年内，获国家励志奖学金的学生，不再发放学校奖学金，只授予学校评定的相应级别的荣誉称号。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十三条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">同一学年内，获得国家励志奖学金的家庭经济困难学生可以同时申请并获得国家助学金，但不能同时获得国家奖学金。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十四条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> 同一学年内，获得国家励志奖学金的学生可以同时申请并获得本科生校长奖。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十五条 </span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">获得国家励志奖学金的学生，有下列情况之一者停发或追回奖学金，收回荣誉称号：</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1.在家庭经济困难学生认定工作中弄虚作假；</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2.消费水平明显高于全校平均，铺张浪费；</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">3.受到警告及警告以上处分。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">第六章 &nbsp;附 &nbsp;则</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十六条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本办法自发布之日施行，原《关于印发&lt;西安电子科技大学国家励志奖学金评审办法（修订）&gt;的通知》（西电学〔2022〕9号）同时废止</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第十七条</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本办法由本科生院负责解释。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><br></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
    
    <p>
